			<div class="content" id="post-content-2618546">
									

<p>Corporate slave box isn't a terrible idea, but the article does nothing with it. There is precisely nothing in this article that someone who has been on this site for a while couldn't guess from the three word description above.</p>
<p>Actually, the distortion on the video irked me, because there was ko good reasom for it to be present.</p>
<p>I would like to see this rewritten; not everything benefits from &quot;more backstory/narrative,&quot; but this could.</p>

